wait 1000
up
expectsince cabinet: dropped 2
wait 800
move 890 690
wait 1500
shot cabdm_p_back
pixel 250 100 F3FFFF
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince cabinet: saved (0)
sum show anon
same kernel
key 08 01
expect cabinet: closed
wait 500
